          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Connect</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}} - enquiries, bookings and bespoke sound-bath offerings in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.\\\" />\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg1:#0f1724; /* ink */\\n      --bg2:#071023; /* deep */\\n      --accent:#8ee7d1; /* mint */\\n      --accent-2:#c68fff; /* lavender */\\n      --muted:#a8b3bf;\\n      --card:#0b1220;\\n      --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);\\n      --radius:14px;\\n      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n    }\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    html,body{height:100%}\\n    body{\\n      margin:0;\\n      background: radial-gradient(1200px 600px at 10% 10%, rgba(198,143,255,0.06), transparent 8%),\\n                  radial-gradient(800px 400px at 90% 80%, rgba(142,231,209,0.04), transparent 6%),\\n                  linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));\\n      color:#e6eef6;\\n      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\\n      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;\\n    }\\n    /* pattern SVG sits behind content */\\n    .pattern-wrap{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.08}\\n    header{\\n      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:28px 34px;backdrop-filter: blur(6px);\\n    }\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    .mark{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#051023}\\n    .brand h1{font-size:16px;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.2px}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px}\\n    nav a:hover{color:var(--accent);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}\\n    main{max-width:1100px;margin:40px auto;padding:32px}\\n    /* Hero */\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:28px;align-items:start}\\n    .card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:28px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}\\n    .eyebrow{display:inline-block;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(142,231,209,0.06),rgba(198,143,255,0.04));color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;font-size:12px}\\n    .hero h2{margin:12px 0 8px;font-size:34px;line-height:1.02}\\n    .hero p.lead{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}\\n    .contact-grid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}\\n    .pill{display:inline-flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:10px 12px;background:var(--glass);border-radius:12px}\\n    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    /* sections */\\n    section{margin-top:22px}\\n    h3{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:20px}\\n    .flow{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}\\n    .step{flex:1;min-width:180px;padding:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent);border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}\\n    ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}\\n    .two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}\\n    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px}\\n    .btn{padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#051023;font-weight:700;border:none;cursor:pointer}\\n    .outline{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);background:transparent;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}\\n    /* form */\\n    form{display:grid;gap:12px}\\n    input,textarea,select{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;color:inherit}\\n    textarea{min-height:110px}\\n    footer{margin:40px 0 80px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;text-align:center}\\n    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    /* responsive */\\n    @media (max-width:980px){\\n      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n      .two-col{grid-template-columns:1fr}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"pattern-wrap\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n    <!-- Decorative SVG pattern, unique to this site. It's intentionally inline to avoid external assets. -->\\n    <svg width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 1600 900\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n      <defs>\\n        <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n          <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#8ee7d1\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/>\\n          <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#c68fff\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.12\\\"/>\\n        </linearGradient>\\n        <pattern id=\\\"p1\\\" width=\\\"160\\\" height=\\\"160\\\" patternUnits=\\\"userSpaceOnUse\\\">\\n          <g fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"url(#g1)\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1\\\">\\n            <path d=\\\"M0 40 L40 0 L80 40 L120 0 L160 40\\\"/>\\n            <path d=\\\"M0 120 L40 80 L80 120 L120 80 L160 120\\\"/>\\n          </g>\\n        </pattern>\\n      </defs>\\n      <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#p1)\\\" />\\n      <g opacity=\\\"0.06\\\">\\n        <circle cx=\\\"1400\\\" cy=\\\"120\\\" r=\\\"220\\\" fill=\\\"#c68fff\\\"/>\\n        <circle cx=\\\"120\\\" cy=\\\"780\\\" r=\\\"260\\\" fill=\\\"#8ee7d1\\\"/>\\n      </g>\\n    </svg>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"mark\\\">SB</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n        <div class=\\\"small\\\">A modern practice of sound & presence</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Welcome</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Gatherings</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"private-sessions.html\\\">Private Offerings</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Investment</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">Origins</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"faq.html\\\">Questions</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <!-- HERO -->\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Reach out</span>\\n        <h2>Find your way here — a brief, luminous exchange.</h2>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Whether you're curious about upcoming sound baths, want a private 1:1, or need a bespoke corporate session, drop a note. We usually reply within 48 hours.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"contact-grid\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">\\n            <svg width=\\\"18\\\" height=\\\"18\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" aria-hidden>\\n              <path d=\\\"M3 8v10a2 2 0 002 2h14\\\" stroke=\\\"#8ee7d1\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n              <path d=\\\"M21 6v-.5A2.5 2.5 0 0018.5 3H5.5A2.5 2.5 0 003 5.5V6\\\" stroke=\\\"#c68fff\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.6\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n            </svg>\\n            <div>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Email</div>\\n              <div>{{EMAIL}}</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"pill\\\">\\n            <svg width=\\\"18\\\" height=\\\"18\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" aria-hidden>\\n              <path d=\\\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2A19.86 19.86 0 013 5.18 2 2 0 015 3h3a2 2 0 012 1.72c.12 1.05.38 2.08.78 3.03a2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L9.91 11.91a14.19 14.19 0 006.17 6.17l1.05-1.05a2 2 0 012.11-.45c.95.4 1.98.66 3.03.78A2 2 0 0122 16.92z\\\" stroke=\\\"#8ee7d1\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.4\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n            </svg>\\n            <div>\\n              <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Call</div>\\n              <div>{{PHONE}}</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"small muted\\\">Quick contact</div>\\n        <form id=\\\"contactForm\\\" action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n          <input name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required />\\n          <input name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Email\\\" required />\\n          <select name=\\\"interest\\\">\\n            <option value=\\\"group\\\">Next group sound bath</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"private\\\">Private session (1:1)</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"couples\\\">Couples</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"corporate\\\">Corporate / event</option>\\n            <option value=\\\"other\\\">Other enquiry</option>\\n          </select>\\n          <textarea name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Tell us a little about what you'd like... (optional)\\\"></textarea>\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:8px\\\">\\n            <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n            <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"outline\\\" onclick=\\\"fillSample()\\\">Quick sample</button>\\n          </div>\\n        </form>\\n        <p class=\\\"small muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">By contacting us you accept that we'll reply via email or phone to coordinate your session. If this is an urgent wellness concern, call emergency services.</p>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- RITUAL: how we respond / booking ritual -->\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"ritual-title\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"ritual-title\\\">The booking ritual — how we make space</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\">A tiny ceremonial roadmap so you know what unfolds after you reach out.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"flow\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <strong>1. Receive</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"small muted\\\">We read your message within 48 hours, asking clarifying questions if needed: goals, accessibility needs, sound sensitivity.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <strong>2. Plan</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"small muted\\\">We propose times and a tailored format — group, 1:1, couples, or corporate — and outline instruments and room layout.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <strong>3. Confirm</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"small muted\\\">Deposit links, arrival info, and a gentle pre-ritual guide are sent. You receive a calendar invite with {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}} for group bookings if applicable.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- WHAT TO EXPECT -->\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"expect-title\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"expect-title\\\">What to bring & what we suggest</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"two-col\\\">\\n        <div>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">For a premium sensory experience, arrive 10–15 minutes early. We offer mats and blankets, but bringing your own favorite blanket or small pillow makes a difference.</p>\\n          <ul>\\n            <li>Comfortable layers — temperatures can shift.</li>\\n            <li>A water bottle; we refresh with herbal water afterward.</li>\\n            <li>Optional eye covering for deep rest (eye pillow recommended).</li>\\n            <li>Notes for the facilitator about recent injuries, pregnancy, or implants.</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n          <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Contraindications & care (please read):</p>\\n          <ul>\\n            <li>Not recommended as a substitute for medical care. If you have seizures, severe psychiatric conditions, or are in the first trimester of pregnancy, consult your healthcare provider first.</li>\\n            <li>Metal implants can resonate differently; let us know ahead of time.</li>\\n            <li>We offer quieter setups for those sensitive to intense vibration.</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <p class=\\\"small muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">Flow of a typical group session: gentle centering → guided breath → immersive soundscape (instruments: crystal bowls, monochord, chimes) → soft return with tea & grounding. Private sessions follow a similar arc but are personalized.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- SCHEDULE -->\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"schedule-title\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"schedule-title\\\">Upcoming rhythm</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Next group gathering: <strong>{{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}</strong> at {{VENUE_NAME}} in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\"><strong>Weekly</strong><span class=\\\"small muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-left:8px\\\">Tuesdays 7pm — soft light</span></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\"><strong>Monthly Full Sound</strong><span class=\\\"small muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-left:8px\\\">First Saturday — extended immersion</span></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"pill\\\"><strong>Private</strong><span class=\\\"small muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-left:8px\\\">By appointment — mornings and weekends available</span></div>\\n      </div>\\n      <p class=\\\"small muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">If you'd like a calendar invite or need to request a specific time window, use the contact form or email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- PRICING SUMMARY -->\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"pricing-title\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"pricing-title\\\">Pricing snapshot</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Retail & add-ons designed for clarity. Final pricing varies with location, length, and group size.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <strong>Drop-in Group</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"small muted\\\">$30 — standard 75 minutes</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <strong>Private 1:1</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"small muted\\\">60 min — $120 (tailored soundmap)</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <strong>Couples</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"small muted\\\">75–90 min — $190</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"step\\\">\\n          <strong>Corporate & Events</strong>\\n          <div class=\\\"small muted\\\">Custom pricing — site visit + quotation</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <p class=\\\"small muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Add-ons: travel, extended length, instrument-specific requests (gong, tuning forks, chimes) are quoted when you enquire.</p>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- FAQ -->\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"faq-title\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"faq-title\\\">Brief questions, simple answers</h3>\\n      <details style=\\\"margin-top:10px;background:transparent;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\\\">\\n        <summary style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">How long is a session?</summary>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Group classes typically run 75 minutes. Private sessions are commonly 60 to 90 minutes.</p>\\n      </details>\\n      <details style=\\\"margin-top:8px;background:transparent;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\\\">\\n        <summary style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Can I record or photograph?</summary>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">We ask that sessions remain screen-free to preserve the communal and introspective space. Facilitator may record portions for promotion only with consent.</p>\\n      </details>\\n      <details style=\\\"margin-top:8px;background:transparent;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.02)\\\">\\n        <summary style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">Which instruments might I hear?</summary>\\n        <p class=\\\"muted\\\">We rotate instruments to craft a layered sound experience: crystal bowls, a gentle gong, tuned chimes, and monochord textures. Private requests like tuning forks or Himalayan bowls are welcome.</p>\\n      </details>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <!-- CALL TO ACTION / CONTACT FORM -->\\n    <section class=\\\"card\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"cta-title\\\">\\n      <h3 id=\\\"cta-title\\\">Ready to connect?</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"muted\\\">Use the form above, email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>, or ring us at <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">{{PHONE}}</a>. We hold space for thoughtful replies.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"outline\\\" href=\\\"events.html\\\">View Gatherings</a>\\n        <a class=\\\"outline\\\" href=\\\"private-sessions.html\\\">Private offerings</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>{{VENUE_NAME}} — Facilitated by {{FACILITATOR_NAME}} · {{BUSINESS_NAME}} · {{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\" class=\\\"small muted\\\">Address and directions available on request. All sessions held in a scent-free environment; please avoid strong fragrances when attending.</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    // Small UX helpers\\n    function fillSample(){\\n      const f = document.getElementById('contactForm');\\n      f.name.value = 'A. Visitor';\\n      f.email.value = 'hello@example.com';\\n      f.message.value = 'Interested in a private session next month. Curious about quieter options — I am sound-sensitive.';\\n      f.interest.value = 'private';\\n    }\\n    document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){\\n      // Basic client-side validation and graceful submission\\n      // In production, this would post to a backend or trigger a third-party form handler.\\n      e.preventDefault();\\n      const data = new FormData(e.target);\\n      const out = {};\\n      data.forEach((v,k)=>out[k]=v);\\n      // Simulate send\\n      alert('Thanks, ' + (out.name||'friend') + '! We\\\\'ll reply to ' + (out.email||'your email') + '.');\\n      e.target.reset();\\n    });\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Chunk 4 — contact page and notes\\\\n\\\\nFiles included:\\\\n- contact.html  — Full contact page with hero, ritual, what_to_expect, schedule, pricing, faq, and cta sections.\\\\n- README.md    — This file (you are reading it).\\\\n\\\\nPlaceholders to replace in your build pipeline or templating engine:\\\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\\\n- {{PHONE}}\\\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\\n- {{CITY}}\\\\n- {{STATE}}\\\\n- {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}\\\\n- {{VENUE_NAME}}\\\\n- {{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}\\\\n\\\\nDesign notes:\\\\n- Visuals rely on inline SVG and pure CSS gradients; no external assets or CDNs are used here.\\\\n- The file intentionally includes an inline decorative SVG pattern so it remains unique without referencing external files.\\\\n- The voice is \\\"mystic_modern\\\" with a \\\"bold_playful\\\" layout: prominent headings, rounded cards, and jewel-toned gradients.\\\\n\\\\nAccessibility & behavior:\\\\n- Forms are basic and unobtrusive; replace form action with your server endpoint (currently uses {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} placeholder in the form).\\\\n- Contact buttons include mailto: and tel: links using placeholders.\\\\n\\\\nContent requirements met:\\\\n- Includes sections: hero, ritual, what_to_expect, schedule, pricing, faq, cta.\\\\n- Provides \\\"what to bring\\\", contraindications, and a description of session flow.\\\\n- Pricing reflects retail_addon model with add-on notes.\\\\n- Instruments are varied in description (crystal bowls, gong, chimes, monochord, tuning forks).\\\\n\\\\nIntegration tips:\\\\n- Swap placeholders server-side or with a simple search-and-replace step before deployment.\\\\n- If you centralize the SVG pattern in assets/img/pattern.svg for other pages, you can replace the inline SVG block with an <img> or background-image reference.\\\\n\\\\nIf you need the parallel pattern file (assets/img/pattern.svg) created now, request the next chunk and I will produce it with a unique motif matching this page.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
